# Loaded automatically by `npm start` (vite dev server).
# Put your sandbox REST App's Client ID here (developer.paypal.com →
# Apps & Credentials → Sandbox). Must match the sandbox merchant whose
# credentials are in server/.env — otherwise verifyOrder will fail with
# a mismatched-merchant error.
#
# If left empty the SDK will not load and the PayPal button won't appear
# — that's deliberate, so you notice before testing payments.
VITE_PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID=
